5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm excited to help pick the best plan for the park. I want to make sure we can actually get the work done on time. Let's get started!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. While timeliness is certainly a virtue, I believe we must ensure the chosen plan harmonizes with the actual physical and social rhythms of the park. Logic suggests we look at the data.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello. I'm happy to be here too. I wonder who will take care of the plants and the paths once the park is finished? I want to know who will be there every day.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Minato. Long-term maintenance is key. I am also interested in the actual quality of previous projects to ensure this redevelopment doesn't deteriorate quickly. Let's look at the evidence.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that we must look beyond the initial construction. I am interested in the long-term financial sustainability of the park's upkeep.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site. That way, we can see if the schedule is actually realistic!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A pragmatic approach, Kenji. For my part, I shall examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings. One must understand how the land and the people actually behave.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think I would like to see the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. Also, maybe the volunteer groups working with the division? I want to see who helps the park.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare. I want to see how previous investments have actually held up over time.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe it would be prudent to examine the upkeep ledger spend per hectare as well. Additionally, I will look into the terms of the regional habitat fund to see what financial support is available.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a great plan! Everyone is looking into different things. I'm really curious to see what the earth-moving firms say about the timeline. I'll stick with my choices!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a diverse set of inquiries. It ensures we aren't all staring at the same corner of the map while the rest of the landscape remains a mystery. I shall remain with my selections.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we are all helping each other. I'll stay with my choices too. I hope I can find out who the kind people are that look after the park.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I am satisfied with my choices. Understanding the actual condition of past works will provide the necessary context to evaluate the longevity of the new proposals. I will proceed with those.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am also content with my selections. Understanding the current spending and potential funding will help us ensure the park remains a sanctuary without becoming a financial burden. I shall proceed.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's hope the information helps us pick a plan that really works for everyone and gets finished on time!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us hope the data provides a sobering reality check to the architectural ambitions we are about to review. I look forward to our findings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm looking forward to it too. I hope we can find a plan that makes everyone happy and keeps the park beautiful for a long time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am also ready. Let us see if the reality of the past matches the promises of the future. I look forward to discussing the findings with you all.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am ready as well. I look forward to seeing how the financial data aligns with the visions presented to us. Until we meet again in the next round.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
