83,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,My vote is for Plan B. It is the most prudent choice for the city's long-term financial health and the only one that avoids an inevitable budget crisis.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
